{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28263","headline":"雨中作 · 杜牧","name":"雨中作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贱子本幽慵，多爲隽贤侮。\n得州荒僻中，更值连江雨。\n一褐拥秋寒，小窗侵竹坞。\n浊醪气色严，皤腹瓶甖古。\n酣酣天地宽，怳怳嵇刘伍。\n但爲适性情，岂是藏鳞羽。\n一世一万朝，朝朝醉中去。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28263.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28263","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}